# Content And Copy Rule

Use this guidance when writing project descriptions, detail-page text, and screenshot notes.

## Project Entry Requirements

Each project must clearly include:
- title
- date
- short description

Detail pages should include:
- additional writing
- screenshots with useful alt text

## Writing Style

- Use plain language.
- Keep descriptions short and concrete.
- Avoid buzzwords and unnecessary marketing tone.
- Prefer clarity over cleverness.

## Formatting Consistency

- Use one date format across all projects.
- Keep naming and slug patterns stable.
- Keep content easy to scan.

